🎬 Krea 2 Img2Img Tutorial For ComfyUI

There's barely any solid img2img workflows for Krea 2 out there, whether you're running the base model, Turbo, or base with Turbo LoRAs. I went looking on CivitAI and came up short, and the few I tested weren't good. Backgrounds fell apart, lighting shifted, surroundings went soft and weird, the whole shot looked fake even when the character looked great.

This video covers how I do Krea 2 img2img the right way. Instead of regenerating the entire image, I mask just the subject and leave the background completely untouched. Same photo, same lighting, same everything, except now your character is in it. Full breakdown covers the required downloads, how the masking works, and the denoise ranges that matter since Krea 2 runs a lot tighter than other checkpoints.

